Question 6 - Logout User
========================

API Endpoint:
GET https://ynt4-cars-dealership.onrender.com/djangoapp/logout

Prerequisite:
The user must already be logged in, with the authenticated
session stored in cookies.txt.

cURL Command:

curl -sS \
  -b cookies.txt -c cookies.txt \
  -w '\nHTTP Status: %{http_code}\n' \
  https://ynt4-cars-dealership.onrender.com/djangoapp/logout

Actual Test Result:

HTTP Status: 200

{
  "userName": "",
  "status": "Logged out"
}

Session Verification After Logout:

curl -sS \
  -b cookies.txt \
  https://ynt4-cars-dealership.onrender.com/djangoapp/session

HTTP Status: 200

{
  "isAuthenticated": false,
  "username": null
}

Result: PASS
